nd isometric views. Now I'm planning the HTML portfolio structure: a header with Hari's info and a section highlighting the three projects with embedded images.\n\nI'm now curating the strongest images per project instead of including everything—picking hero shots and key detail views for ONGC, EXIT 15, and ITC Green Centre to keep the portfolio visually impactful.\n\nNow I'll build the HTML portfolio file in the project directory, then trim portfolio.md down to just these three curated projects.","tool_calls":[{"name":"list_dir","args":{"DirectoryPath":"C:\\Users\\intel\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\399129cf-afba-4b62-ab55-46c1b5e0130d\\.user_uploaded","toolAction":"Listing uploaded images","toolSummary":"User uploaded images"}}]}
