{"step_index":59,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T05:09:12Z","content":"Your portfolio should now be open in your browser! Here's what I built for you:\n\n### What's included:\n\n**Header** — Your name, title, contact info, and key stats (4+ years, LOD 400, 95%+ clash resolution, 3 countries, ISO 19650).\n\n**Core Competencies** — Your tools, automation skills, standards, and coordination capabilities organized in a clean grid.\n\n**3 Project Case Studies** (the ones you provided images for):\n\n| # | Project | Role | Key Skill Showcased |\n|---|---------|------|---------------------|\n| 01 | **ONGC Oil & Gas (250 Acres)** | BIM Engineer | Scan-to-BIM, Point Cloud Accuracy |\n| 02 | **EXIT 15 – Theming Steel** | BIM Team Lead | IFC Interoperability, Automation, Leadership |\n| 03 | **ITC Green Centre** | BIM Team Lead | LOD 450 Parametric Families |\n\nEach project has the **Challenge → Process → Deliverable** structure plus an **image gallery** with clickable images (click any image to zoom in).\n\n### How to save as PDF:\n1. In your browser, press **Ctrl + P**\n2. Change the printer to **\"Save as PDF\"**\n3. Save it!\n\n### The file is here:\n`C:\\Users\\intel\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\399129cf-afba-4b62-ab55-46c1b5e0130d\\portfolio.html`\n\nLet me know if you'd like any changes to the design, text, or layout!"}
