{"step_index":61,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T05:21:47Z","content":"Let me create a completely fresh, more visually striking design for you.","thinking":"The user wants a more visually appealing design for their BIM portfolio. Let me create a completely redesigned HTML portfolio with a more modern, striking visual design. I'll think about what would make it more appealing:\n\n1. A more dramatic visual style - maybe a dark theme or a split-color scheme\n2. Better typography with Google Fonts\n3. More visual hierarchy with larger hero images\n4. Animated/interactive elements\n5. A more magazine/editorial layout style\n6. Better use of color accents\n7. Maybe a sidebar or timeline layout\n8. Better image presentation - maybe masonry grid or carousel\n\nLet me create something that feels more like a premium design portfolio rather than a corporate document. I'll go with:\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Hari Govind R.B — BIM Portfolio</title>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n        :root {\n            --bg-dark: #0b0f19;\n            --bg-card: #111827;\n            --bg-card-alt: #1a2235;\n            --accent: #3b82f6;\n            --accent-glow: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);\n            --accent-2: #06b6d4;\n            --accent-3: #8b5cf6;\n            --orange: #f59e0b;\n            --green: #10b981;\n            --text: #e2e8f0;\n            --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n            --text-dim: #64748b;\n            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n            --border-accent: rgba(59,130,246,0.3);\n        }\n\n        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n            background: var(--bg-dark);\n            color: var(--text);\n            line-height: 1.7;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== HERO ===== */\n        .hero {\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 60px 24px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .hero::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -50%;\n            left: -20%;\n            width: 600px;\n            height: 600px;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59,130,246,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .hero::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: -30%;\n            right: -10%;\n            width: 500px;\n            height: 500px;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(139,92,246,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .hero-label {\n            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            letter-spacing: 4px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            color: var(--accent);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .hero h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 72px);\n            font-weight: 800;\n            letter-spacing: -2px;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #94a3b8 100%);\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n            background-clip: text;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .hero .role {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            font-weight: 300;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n        .hero .role strong {\n            color: var(--accent);\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        .stats-row {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 1px;\n            background: var(--border);\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .stat {\n            background: var(--bg-card);\n            padding: 24px 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            min-width: 140px;\n        }\n        .stat .val {\n            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;\n            font-size: 26px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n        .stat .lbl {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n            color: var(--text-dim);\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .contact-pills {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 12px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            justify-content: center;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .contact-pills a, .contact-pills span {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 6px;\n            padding: 8px 18px;\n            border-radius: 100px;\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            font-size: 13px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n        }\n        .contact-pills a:hover {\n            border-color: var(--accent);\n            color: var(--accent);\n            background: var(--accent-glow);\n        }\n\n        .scroll-hint {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 30px;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translateX(-50%);\n            color: var(--text-dim);\n            font-size: 12px;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            animation: bounce 2s infinite;\n        }\n        @keyframes bounce {\n            0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }\n            50% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(8px); }\n        }\n\n        /* ===== SECTION ===== */\n        .section {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 80px 24px;\n        }\n        .section-label {\n            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            letter-spacing: 4px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            color: var(--accent);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n        .section-heading {\n            font-size: 36px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            letter-spacing: -1px;\n            margin-bottom: 48px;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== SKILLS GRID ===== */\n        .skills-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n            gap: 16px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .skill-card {\n            background: var(--bg-card);\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 28px;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n        }\n        .skill-card:hover {\n            border-color: var(--border-accent);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n        }\n        .skill-card .icon {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-size: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n        }\n        .skill-card .icon.blue { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1); }\n        .skill-card .icon.cyan { background: rgba(6,182,212,0.1); }\n        .skill-card .icon.purple { background: rgba(139,92,246,0.1); }\n        .skill-card .icon.orange { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.1); }\n        .skill-card h4 {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #fff;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .skill-card .tags {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 6px;\n        }\n        .skill-card .tags span {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            padding: 3px 10px;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n        }\n\n        /* ===== PROJECT CARD ===== */\n        .project {\n            margin-bottom: 100px;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .project-num {\n            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;\n            font-size: 120px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -40px;\n            left: -10px;\n            line-height: 1;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            user-select: none;\n        }\n\n        .project-hero {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 480px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            margin-bottom: 32px;\n        }\n        .project-hero img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            transition: transform 0.5s;\n        }\n        .project-hero:hover img {\n            transform: scale(1.03);\n        }\n        .project-hero .overlay {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            padding: 40px 32px 28px;\n            background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.85));\n        }\n        .project-hero .overlay .tag-row {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 8px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n        .project-hero .overlay .ptag {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n            padding: 4px 12px;\n            border-radius: 100px;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n        .ptag.loc { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); }\n        .ptag.role-tag { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.4); }\n        .ptag.sector { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.3); }\n\n        .project-hero .overlay h3 {\n            font-size: 28px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #fff;\n            letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n        }\n\n        .project-content {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 24px;\n        }\n        .project-content.full {\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        }\n\n        .content-card {\n            background: var(--bg-card);\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 32px;\n        }\n        .content-card.highlight {\n            border-color: var(--border-accent);\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-card) 0%, rgba(59,130,246,0.03) 100%);\n        }\n        .content-card h4 {\n            font-size: 13px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            color: var(--accent);\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;\n        }\n        .content-card p {\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n        .content-card ul {\n            list-style: none;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n        .content-card ul li {\n            position: relative;\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n        .content-card ul li::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            top: 10px;\n            width: 6px;\n            height: 6px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: var(--accent);\n        }\n        .content-card ul li strong {\n            color: var(--text);\n        }\n\n        .tools-row {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 8px;\n            margin-top: 16px;\n        }\n        .tool-chip {\n            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            padding: 5px 14px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            background: rgba(59,130,246,0.08);\n            color: var(--accent);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.15);\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== GALLERY ===== */\n        .gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 24px;\n        }\n        .gallery-section .gallery-label {\n            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 3px;\n            color: var(--text-dim);\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n        }\n        .gallery-masonry {\n            columns: 3;\n            column-gap: 12px;\n        }\n        .gallery-masonry img {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n            display: block;\n        }\n        .gallery-masonry img:hover {\n            border-color: var(--border-accent);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--accent-glow);\n            transform: scale(1.01);\n        }\n\n        /* ===== FOOTER ===== */\n        .footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 60px 24px;\n            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n        }\n        .footer h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #fff;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n        .footer p {\n            color: var(--text-dim);\n            font-size: 14px;\n            max-width: 600px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .footer .quote {\n            margin-top: 24px;\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: var(--text-dim);\n            font-size: 13px;\n            padding: 16px 24px;\n            border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);\n            display: inline-block;\n            text-align: left;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== LIGHTBOX ===== */\n        .lightbox {\n            display: none;\n            position: fixed;\n            inset: 0;\n            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.95);\n            z-index: 1000;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            cursor: zoom-out;\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n        }\n        .lightbox.active { display: flex; }\n        .lightbox img {\n            max-width: 94vw;\n            max-height: 94vh;\n            object-fit: contain;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .stats-row { flex-wrap: wrap; border-radius: 12px; }\n            .stat { min-width: 100px; padding: 16px 20px; }\n            .project-hero { height: 280px; }\n            .project-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .gallery-masonry { columns: 2; }\n            .project-num { font-size: 80px; }\n        }\n        @media (max-width: 500px) {\n            .gallery-masonry { columns: 1; }\n        }\n\n        /* ===== PRINT ===== */\n        @media print {\n            body { background: #fff; color: #111; }\n            .hero { min-height: auto; padding: 30px; }\n            .hero h1 { -webkit-text-fill-color: #111; font-size: 32px; }\n            .project { break-inside: avoid; }\n            .lightbox { display: none !important; }\n            .scroll-hint { display: none; }\n            .project-hero { height: 300px; }\n            .content-card { background: #f8f9fa; border-color: #ddd; }\n            .content-card h4 { color: #0077b6; }\n            .content-card ul li { color: #333; }\n            .stat { background: #f0f0f0; }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- ===== HERO ===== -->\n<section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"hero-label\">BIM Engineering Portfolio</div>\n    <h1>Hari Govind R.B</h1>\n    <div class=\"role\">BIM Engineer — Specialized in <strong>Architectural</strong>, <strong>Structural</strong>, <strong>Facade</strong> & <strong>Steel BIM</strong></div>\n\n    <div class=\"stats-row\">\n        <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"val\">4+</div>\n            <div class=\"lbl\">Years Exp.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"val\">LOD 450</div>\n            <div class=\"lbl\">Max Delivery</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"val\">95%+</div>\n            <div class=\"lbl\">Clash Resolution</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"val\">3</div>\n            <div class=\"lbl\">Countries</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"val\">ISO 19650</div>\n            <div class=\"lbl\">CDE Standard</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"contact-pills\">\n        <span>📞 +91 81590 02295</span>\n        <span>✉️ harigovindhrb@gmail.com</span>\n        <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/in/harigovindrb\" target=\"_blank\">🔗 LinkedIn</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"scroll-hint\">↓ Scroll to explore</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ===== SKILLS ===== -->\n<section class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-label\">What I Bring</div>\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">Core Competencies</div>\n\n    <div class=\"skills-grid\">\n        <div class=\"skill-card\">\n            <div class=\"icon blue\">🖥️</div>\n            <h4>BIM Software</h4>\n            <div class=\"tags\">\n                <span>Autodesk Revit</span>\n                <span>Navisworks Manage</span>\n                <span>ACC (BIM 360)</span>\n                <span>AutoCAD</span>\n                <span>SketchUp</span>\n                <span>3ds Max</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"skill-card\">\n            <div class=\"icon purple\">⚡</div>\n            <h4>Automation & Scripting</h4>\n            <div class=\"tags\">\n                <span>Dynamo</span>\n                <span>PyRevit</span>\n                <span>DiRoots</span>\n                <span>Grasshopper</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"skill-card\">\n            <div class=\"icon cyan\">📐</div>\n            <h4>Standards & Workflows</h4>\n            <div class=\"tags\">\n                <span>ISO 19650</span>\n                <span>LOD 300–450</span>\n                <span>IFC / openBIM</span>\n                <span>Scan-to-BIM</span>\n                <span>CAD-to-BIM</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"skill-card\">\n            <div class=\"icon orange\">🔗</div>\n            <h4>Coordination & QA</h4>\n            <div class=\"tags\">\n                <span>Clash Detection</span>\n                <span>Federated Models</span>\n                <span>QA/QC Audits</span>\n                <span>Worksharing</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ===== PROJECTS ===== -->\n<section class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-label\">Selected Work</div>\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">Project Case Studies</div>\n\n    <!-- PROJECT 1: ONGC -->\n    <article class=\"project\">\n        <div class=\"project-num\">01</div>\n\n        <div class=\"project-hero\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this.querySelector('img'))\">\n            <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789394170911.jpg\" alt=\"ONGC Full Site\">\n            <div class=\"overlay\">\n                <div class=\"tag-row\">\n                    <span class=\"ptag loc\">📍 Uran, Maharashtra</span>\n                    <span class=\"ptag sector\">🏭 Oil & Gas</span>\n                    <span class=\"ptag role-tag\">👤 BIM Engineer</span>\n                </div>\n                <h3>ONGC Oil & Gas Facility — Structural Health Assessment</h3>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"project-content\">\n            <div class=\"content-card\">\n                <h4>The Challenge</h4>\n                <p>\n                    Following an on-site accident at this massive 250-acre oil and gas processing plant, there was a critical need \n                    to assess the structural stability of the affected areas and facilitate safe reconstruction. The challenge was \n                    accurately capturing the complex, real-world conditions of damaged industrial steel structures, pipe racks, \n                    storage tanks, and support trestles.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"tools-row\">\n                    <span class=\"tool-chip\">Revit</span>\n                    <span class=\"tool-chip\">FARO Point Cloud</span>\n                    <span class=\"tool-chip\">Scan-to-BIM</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"content-card highlight\">\n                <h4>My Process & Impact</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><strong>Scan-to-BIM Conversion:</strong> Using FARO scan data, I reverse-engineered and modeled complex industrial steel structures in Revit — tanks, pipe supports, trestles, multi-level sheds, and equipment foundations.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Dimensional Fidelity:</strong> Maintained precise accuracy against the point cloud to create a true \"digital twin\" for structural assessment.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Documentation:</strong> Produced structural layout sheets with plans, sections, elevations, and cross-sections directly from the coordinated BIM model.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Outcome:</strong> Provided the exact geometric baseline required for structural stability reports and the subsequent plant reconstruction.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-label\">Project Gallery</div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-masonry\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789394022257.jpg\" alt=\"Tank Farm 3D\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789394022378.jpg\" alt=\"MPRS Layout Sheet\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789394022363.jpg\" alt=\"Steel Trestles\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789394170924.jpg\" alt=\"MCTR1 Elevations\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789394022370.jpg\" alt=\"Shed Structure\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789394022381.jpg\" alt=\"T-601B Support\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789394158521.jpg\" alt=\"Facility 3D\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789394140311.jpg\" alt=\"Truss Layout\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789394170920.jpg\" alt=\"Equipment Layout\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- PROJECT 2: EXIT 15 -->\n    <article class=\"project\">\n        <div class=\"project-num\">02</div>\n\n        <div class=\"project-hero\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this.querySelector('img'))\">\n            <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397353897.png\" alt=\"EXIT 15 Theming Model\">\n            <div class=\"overlay\">\n                <div class=\"tag-row\">\n                    <span class=\"ptag loc\">📍 Riyadh, Saudi Arabia</span>\n                    <span class=\"ptag sector\">🎢 Entertainment</span>\n                    <span class=\"ptag role-tag\">👤 BIM Team Lead</span>\n                </div>\n                <h3>EXIT 15 — Theming Support Steel (Water Park)</h3>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"project-content\">\n            <div class=\"content-card\">\n                <h4>The Challenge</h4>\n                <p>\n                    For the Water Park sector of the massive EXIT 15 entertainment complex, I led the BIM delivery for highly \n                    complex structural theming steel. The challenge was interpreting engineering calculations and converting external \n                    structural models from Tekla into fully detailed, fabrication-ready Revit models — complete with all connections, \n                    base plates, anchor bolts, gusset plates, and welding details — all while managing and mentoring a modeling team.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"tools-row\">\n                    <span class=\"tool-chip\">Revit Steel</span>\n                    <span class=\"tool-chip\">Tekla → IFC</span>\n                    <span class=\"tool-chip\">Dynamo</span>\n                    <span class=\"tool-chip\">Navisworks</span>\n                    <span class=\"tool-chip\">ACC</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"content-card highlight\">\n                <h4>My Process & Impact</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><strong>IFC Interoperability:</strong> Led the workflow to convert Tekla IFC models into native Revit elements, meticulously modeling all steel connections using Revit Steel.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Team Leadership:</strong> Mentored the modeling team on advanced Revit Steel features, troubleshot technical issues, and kept production on pace.</li>\n                    <li><strong>BIM Automation:</strong> Introduced custom Dynamo scripts and plugins to accelerate repetitive steel detailing tasks and reduce manual errors.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Fabrication Documentation:</strong> Produced LOD 350+ shop drawings with connection details, enlarged annotated plans, and coordinate-based layout sheets for on-site erection.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-label\">Project Gallery</div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-masonry\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789395391202.png\" alt=\"Federated Model\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397353872.png\" alt=\"3D Annotated\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789395386971.png\" alt=\"Curved Steel\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397328762.png\" alt=\"Connection Drawing\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789396225561.png\" alt=\"Steel Detail\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397340363.png\" alt=\"Full Elevation\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397353877.png\" alt=\"Steel Connections\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397340315.png\" alt=\"Connection Plate\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789396225589.png\" alt=\"Facade Section\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397328754.png\" alt=\"Enlarged Plan\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397353917.png\" alt=\"Play-Doh Theming\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397353882.png\" alt=\"Wireframe Overview\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- PROJECT 3: ITC GREEN CENTRE -->\n    <article class=\"project\">\n        <div class=\"project-num\">03</div>\n\n        <div class=\"project-hero\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this.querySelector('img'))\">\n            <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397769468.png\" alt=\"ITC Green Centre\">\n            <div class=\"overlay\">\n                <div class=\"tag-row\">\n                    <span class=\"ptag loc\">📍 Bengaluru, India</span>\n                    <span class=\"ptag sector\">🏢 Commercial</span>\n                    <span class=\"ptag role-tag\">👤 BIM Team Lead</span>\n                </div>\n                <h3>ITC Green Centre — 15-Story Commercial Tower (LOD 450 Facade)</h3>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"project-content\">\n            <div class=\"content-card\">\n                <h4>The Challenge</h4>\n                <p>\n                    This 15-story commercial tower demanded extremely high-fidelity modeling of its entire exterior facade system. \n                    The challenge was developing LOD 450 facade families — not standard curtain walls, but highly complex parametric \n                    assemblies containing hundreds of nested sub-components. This was the most technically demanding family creation \n                    I had undertaken at that point in my career.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"tools-row\">\n                    <span class=\"tool-chip\">Revit Family Editor</span>\n                    <span class=\"tool-chip\">Navisworks</span>\n                    <span class=\"tool-chip\">LOD 450</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"content-card highlight\">\n                <h4>My Process & Impact</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><strong>Advanced Parametric Families:</strong> Personally engineered LOD 450 facade families with hundreds of nested sub-components, managing complex parametric constraints for fabrication-level accuracy.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Team Coordination:</strong> Led a dedicated team to deploy these families across the entire 15-story building and generate comprehensive sheet documentation.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Deliverable:</strong> Produced incredibly accurate, data-rich facade models with detailed shop drawings, seamlessly bridging design intent and manufacturing.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-label\">Project Gallery</div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-masonry\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397769484.png\" alt=\"ITC 3D Dark\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n                <img src=\".user_uploaded/media_1789397769407.png\" alt=\"ITC Elevation\" onclick=\"openLightbox(this)\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>\n\n</section>\n\n<!-- ===== FOOTER ===== -->\n<section class=\"footer\">\n    <h3>Let's Build Together</h3>\n    <p>harigovindhrb@gmail.com &nbsp;·&nbsp; +91 81590 02295 &nbsp;·&nbsp; linkedin.com/in/harigovindrb</p>\n    <div class=\"quote\">\n        \"A good portfolio doesn't just show what you made. It shows how you think, how you work, and how you solve problems through BIM.\"\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ===== LIGHTBOX ===== -->\n<div class=\"lightbox\" id=\"lightbox\" onclick=\"closeLightbox()\">\n    <img id=\"lightbox-img\" src=\"\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n\n<script>\n    function openLightbox(el) {\n        document.getElementById('lightbox-img').src = el.src;\n        document.getElementById('lightbox').classList.add('active');\n    }\n    function closeLightbox() {\n        document.getElementById('lightbox').classList.remove('active');\n    }\n    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n        if (e.key === 'Escape') closeLightbox();\n    });\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Completely redesigned BIM portfolio with a modern dark theme, large hero images, masonry gallery, animated stats, glowing accents, and a premium editorial feel.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\intel\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\399129cf-afba-4b62-ab55-46c1b5e0130d\\portfolio.html","toolAction":"Creating redesigned portfolio","toolSummary":"New portfolio design"}}]}
