{"step_index":65,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T05:24:17Z","content":"It should be open in your browser now! Here's what's new in this redesign:\n\n### Design Changes\n| Feature | Old Design | New Design |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Theme** | Light/white background | Dark premium theme with subtle blue/purple glows |\n| **Typography** | System fonts | Google Fonts (Plus Jakarta Sans + Space Grotesk) |\n| **Hero Section** | Small header | Full-screen landing with animated scroll hint |\n| **Project Layout** | Card with text + grid gallery | Large cinematic hero image + split content cards + masonry gallery |\n| **Project Numbers** | Small label | Giant transparent \"01\", \"02\", \"03\" watermarks |\n| **Image Gallery** | Uniform grid | Pinterest-style masonry layout |\n| **Interactions** | Basic hover | Glow borders, image zoom on hover, lightbox |\n| **Skills** | Simple list | Hover-interactive cards with icons |\n\n### Key features:\n- **Click any image** to view it full-screen (press Escape to close)\n- **Ctrl + P → Save as PDF** still works for print\n- **Responsive** — looks good on mobile too\n\nTake a look and let me know what you think! Want any tweaks to colors, layout, or content?"}
